                [
                    135.0,
                    159.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Negotiations may be requested in writing by either party. Requests for negotiations will state the specific subject matter to be considered at such sessions. The Parties should then agree to meet to discuss the rules for such negotiations which will be codified in a memorandum of understanding.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                185,
                1066,
                299
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    185.0
                ],
                [
                    1066.0,
                    185.0
                ],
                [
                    1066.0,
                    299.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    299.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 6.4 - Unfair Labor Practices (ULP)",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                324,
                620,
                353
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    324.0
                ],
                [
                    620.0,
                    324.0
                ],
                [
                    620.0,
                    353.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    353.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Management and the Union agree that prior to either party submitting an Unfair Labor Practice (ULP) charge to the Federal Labor Relations Authority (FLRA), the charging Party will notify the other and request a meeting in an attempt to resolve a suspected ULP. The meeting will be an informal attempt to resolve the matter(s) in dispute.",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                379,
                1031,
                521
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    379.0
                ],
                [
                    1031.0,
                    379.0
                ],
                [
                    1031.0,
                    521.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    521.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. If after 15 days from the initial notice a solution agreeable to both parties has not been reached, the charging party will then be allowed to file a formal ULP charge.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                545,
                1034,
                604
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    1034.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    1034.0,
                    604.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    604.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. If the issue is not resolved under paragraph 2, the charging party must file the ULP IAW 5 USC 7118.",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                628,
                1057,
                686
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    628.0
                ],
                [
                    1057.0,
                    628.0
                ],
                [
                    1057.0,
                    686.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    686.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 6.5 - Official Time and Travel of Union Representatives",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                712,
                860,
                742
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    712.0
                ],
                [
                    860.0,
                    712.0
                ],
                [
                    860.0,
                    742.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    742.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Union Representatives may be permitted a reasonable amount of official time to effectively represent Employees in accordance with this agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                767,
                1028,
                826
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    767.0
                ],
                [
                    1028.0,
                    767.0
                ],
                [
                    1028.0,
                    826.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    826.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Official time will be requested through appropriate Supervisor and properly recorded on time and attendance records in accordance with Agency time keeping procedures.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                850,
                1072,
                910
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    850.0
                ],
                [
                    1072.0,
                    850.0
                ],
                [
                    1072.0,
                    910.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    910.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Parties are responsible for paying travel costs for their designated representatives.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                934,
                924,
                992
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    934.0
                ],
                [
                    924.0,
                    934.0
                ],
                [
                    924.0,
                    992.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    992.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Reasonable time for representational activities (i.e., discussions, meetings, and investigations) shall be that amount of time determined by both Parties to effectively resolve a matter of concern or review, evaluate a proposed policy change and formulate a recommendation, or negotiate a given proposal.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                1017,
                1080,
                1132
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    1017.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    1017.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    1132.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    1132.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Management agrees to allow the Union a reasonable amount of time for negotiation preparation, to be defined by the memorandum of understanding (MOU) prior to the negotiation process.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                1156,
                1068,
                1243
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    1156.0
                ],
                [
                    1068.0,
                    1156.0
                ],
                [
                    1068.0,
                    1243.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    1243.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Union Representatives will obtain supervisory approval before leaving their work areas. The request should state their destination, estimated time of return, and the nature of Union business. Request for absences for Official Time will be made utilizing the official time request form identified in Appendix A. Whenever practical the request form will be completed prior to performing the Official Time.",
            "block_bbox": [
                128,
                1267,
                1061,
                1410
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
